eckpoints, then resyncs.", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "re74", "originalText": "API flag auth-mount (Vercel Flags): local mounts Better Auth on the API, delegate answers 308 for /api/auth/* and /.well-known/* to AUTH_URL,\noff returns 404 and uses the shared package only. Logout or org switch wipes the local DB + checkpoints, then resyncs.", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}